WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.764 --> 00:00:11.323
Relationship Manager brings every connection you have into one place: LinkedIn, Facebook, X, your address book and your email.

2
00:00:11.323 --> 00:00:23.525
Start by signing in. Each person has their own account, and accounts can share workspaces with a team.

3
00:00:23.525 --> 00:00:30.621
This is your dashboard. The top row shows how many people, relationships, interactions and companies are in the workspace.

4
00:00:30.621 --> 00:00:35.798
Below that are the four circles. Every person belongs to one or more of them.

5
00:00:35.798 --> 00:00:40.423
Personal is friends and family, from Facebook, your contacts and personal email.

6
00:00:40.423 --> 00:00:45.039
Business is professional contacts outside your company, mostly LinkedIn and work email.

7
00:00:45.039 --> 00:00:50.021
Corporate is people inside your own organisation, matched by your corporate email domains.

8
00:00:50.021 --> 00:00:54.767
And Social is the wider public network: followers and follows on X.

9
00:00:54.767 --> 00:01:00.420
Further down you can see activity over time, your strongest relationships and your top companies.

10
00:01:00.420 --> 00:01:07.747
The rail on the left takes you to the Network views, the People directory, Import, Learn and Settings.

11
00:01:07.747 --> 00:01:14.403
The theme follows your system, and you can switch between light and dark at any time.

12
00:01:14.403 --> 00:01:19.932
That is the tour. The next videos walk through importing your data and exploring the visualisations.
